    "reason": "Retrieval-context conditioning, self-play retraining, and confidence pruning each fail to improve \u2014 and mostly degrade \u2014 held-out final overlap and structural agreement versus the plain trained rule. Leave-one-out retrieval is more reliable over the training corpus than for held-out variants, so the model over-trusts consensus features that mislead at evaluation time. The retrieval ceiling additionally bounds every exemplar-template strategy below the assisted stability bar on this corpus.",
